[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11642.63, "timestamp": "03:14:02", "text": "所以，我很高兴能帮到你们。等待，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11645.99, "timestamp": "03:14:05", "text": "帮不了你们。我很高兴能这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11651.51, "timestamp": "03:14:11", "text": "你管它叫什么？呃，两个都玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11653.59, "timestamp": "03:14:13", "text": "嗯，你好，罗伯特·杰克逊，欢迎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11656.469, "timestamp": "03:14:16", "text": "欢迎，我马上要结束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11659.91, "timestamp": "03:14:19", "text": "我很好，你怎么样？有点累了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11661.91, "timestamp": "03:14:21", "text": "我同时进行两场直播，而且我还需要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11666.71, "timestamp": "03:14:26", "text": "现在要出门，但我真的病得很重。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11669.19, "timestamp": "03:14:29", "text": "我对此没有任何借口，而且……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11673.99, "timestamp": "03:14:33", "text": "疼痛嘛，大概持续了一个小时，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11676.55, "timestamp": "03:14:36", "text": "做，并且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11681.83, "timestamp": "03:14:41", "text": "总之，我们去了咖啡馆。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11685.19, "timestamp": "03:14:45", "text": "呃，模拟器，在之前的直播中，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11688.389, "timestamp": "03:14:48", "text": "现在我们玩了《守望先锋》。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11691.75, "timestamp": "03:14:51", "text": "是的。是的。所以我觉得明天不会有事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11696.229, "timestamp": "03:14:56", "text": "我会直播，但我会尽力。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11698.87, "timestamp": "03:14:58", "text": "任何人"}]